  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliliyi Davidi nindi apandakani hewulu damukandu chanti, kukasumuka ŋamba yaMefwibosheti Ziba hakumukinkilila navi mbulu yiyedi yakulema dehi sadi, anasendi makulakaji amankendi ayedi, ninkulakaji yanyikanji yanyikabu yavinyu yakwanyika, ninkulakaji yanyi kabu yahamwaka wanvula, ninswaha yavinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wamwilili Ziba, nindi, Iyi yuma yansagwinyi? Ziba nindi, Yimbulu yakwendela akwetala damwanta. Mankendi nanyikabu yahamwaka wanvula yakudya anyi kwenzi. Vinyu yakunwa akufwa chinzeya mwisaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nindi, Indi mwana kamwanta weyi yodihi? Ziba hakumwila mwanta, nindi, Nashakami kwindi kuYerusalema. Muloŋa yena neli nindi, Lelu akwamu taŋa waIsarela akunlubwila wanta watata yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakumwila Ziba, nindi, Yuma yaMefwibosheti yejima yinekali dehi yeyeyi. Ziba nindi, Nalembi dehi mwani, niwani luwi kumesu eyi, eyi nkaka yami, eyi mwanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashikiliyi mwanta Davidi kuBahurimi, kukasumuka kwenoku hiku kufuma iyala wachisaka chakumutaŋa waSawulu, ijina dindi Shimeyi, mwana kaGera. Hakwidika, hakwinza nakushiŋana hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumwasa Davidi malola, hakwasa niambuŋamwanta Davidi ejima. Antu ejima niayilobu ejima adiŋi awa kuchikasa chindi chachidiilu, awa kuchikasa chindi chachi munswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashiŋeniyi Shimeyi, hakuhosha nindi, Yaku! Yaku! Eyi muntu wamashi eyi! Eyi muntu wamukunkulwayi eyi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova naku hilwishili dehi mashi amutaŋa waSawulu wukweti wanta windi wunatambuli. Wanta anawinki dehi mwaneyi Abisalomi kudi Yehova. Yuma yeyi yatama yiwakoŋaŋa yinakuhilukili dehi eyi aweni muloŋa eyi wumuntu wamashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaZeruwiya Abishayi, hakumwila mwanta, nindi, Iwu mufu wakawa wudi nakushiŋiladi nkaka yami mwanta? Nleki mwani niyuku nakamuketuli mutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakwila nindi, Enu anyana kaZeruwiya, ami nidi nenu nansaŋu? Ichi chakushiŋanayi, chanamwiliyi dehi Yehova, nindi, Mushiŋi Davidi, hamwekani wukwila nindi, Muloŋanyi wuneli chochichi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi hakwila Abishayi niambuŋindi ejima, nindi, Chikaŋa mwanami wakufuma mwivumu damami aweni, yowu wudi nakufwila kunjaha, winzi wumoni iwu kaBenjamini? Muleki tuhu kwindi, ashiŋani kwindi. Yehova diyi namuleji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadaha Yehova wakatala yatama yanankoŋuwu, Yehova hakanlubwila yayiwahi neshiŋu dananshiŋuwu lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi nawantu indi hiyakuya munjila, Shimeyi niyena hakuya nakukulisha mwivumu dampidi kwatalaŋana nayena, iku wudi nakuya, iku wudi nakushiŋana, nikumwasa malola, nikukuwa lunkuŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta nawantu ejima adiŋiyi nawu ashikili azeya dehi. Hakunookela kwenoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisalomi namayala aIsarela ejima ashikili kuYerusalema, hamu naAhitofweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibwambu daDavidi Hushayi wakuAraki chashikiliyi kudi Abisalomi, Hushayi hakumwila Abisalomi, nindi, Kalombu mwanta. Kalombu mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisalomi hakumwila Hushayi, nindi, Kweniku diku kukeŋa kuwukukeŋa ibwambu deyi tahindi? Wabuliladi kuya nebwa mbudeyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushayi hakumwila Abisalomi, nindi, Nehi kwami. Nukwikala wambala waniwu akutondawu kudi Yehova, nikudi antu awa, nikudi amayala aIsarela ejima, diyi nukushakama nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu inukukalakela yowinyi? Hiyowu mwaninduku? Chinadiŋi nakukalakela tata yeyi dichi chinukukukalakelaŋa eyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisalomi hakumwila Ahitofweli, nindi, Tuleji maana. Tukwila ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahitofweli hakumwila Abisalomi, nindi, Iŋilaku mudi antombu jatata yeyi anashiyiyi nakuhemba itala, kulonda aIsarela ejima akatiyi nawu tata yeyi nakutiyi dehi kutama nankashi, kulonda awa wudi nawu akakwati luku Ŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumulemena Abisalomi itenti hewulu detala. Abisalomi hakwijila mudi antombu jatata yindi, aIsarela ejima amonaŋa namesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana aAhitofweli alejelaŋayi akwawu mafuku owu adiŋi neyi muntu nehuli izu kudi Nzambi. Dichi chadiŋi maana aAhitofweli, nikudi Davidi, nikudi Abisalomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
